langen^"Like me?^@^  Oh, I still have a long way to go.^@^  I still have very little experience out there in the real world, and I need to work on becoming more confident and sociable.^@^  ...I think you've far surpassed me on all of those counts, Battler-kun.^@^  I'm sure you'll outstrip me fast enough when you become an adult."^@
