langen^Okay.^@^  Now we have the entire group of family members who are going to board the plane.^\

langjp　まるでそれを見届けたかのようなタイミングで、ロビーに放送があった。\
langen^At that moment, as though it had waited for us all to arrive, an announcement rang out through the lobby.^\

langjp「お待たせしました。@新島行き２０１便の搭乗をこれより開始いたします。@ご搭乗のお客様はカウンター前の、白線前に２列でお並び下さい。」\
langen^"Our apologies for the delay.^@^  Boarding will now commence for Flight 201 to Niijima.^@^  We ask that the passengers please form two lines in front of the counter, behind the white line."^\

ld r,$RUD_DefA1,24

langjp「楼座、搭乗手続きまだだろ、急げ急げ。」@
langen^"Rosa, you still haven't gone through boarding procedures, right?^@^  Hurry up."^@
