langjp　元気そうには振舞ってるが、頭痛だの腰痛だのと体はボロボロ。@正直なところ、まだ勤めてるってだけでも大したもんなくらいさ。\
langen^She might act as though she's in good health, but between the headaches and her lumbago, her body is wearing out.^@^  To tell the truth, the very fact that she's still working is impressive.^\


langjp　…今年でいくつだったっけ？@　
langen^...How old is she this year again?^@
br
