;＜楼座
langen^"You just seem to get more and more lively.^@^  Oh, that's right, here you are.^@^  It's the tea I told you about before.^@^  Look, I bought you some.^@^  Please do try it later on."^@

langjp　楼座叔母さんは荷物からお土産の入った袋を出して見せる。@
