langen^"Dammit, ...go ahead and laugh.^@^  One of these days, I'm gonna find your weakness and get back at you...and then your boobs will be mine to squish......"^@

ld l,$JES_WaraiA1,80

langjp「あっはっはっは、見付られたら考えてやるぜー？！@　わーっはっはっは！」\
langen^"Ahahaha!^@^  Yeah, sure, good luck with that!^@^  Waah-hah-hah-ha!"^\

ld c,$MAR_DefA1,23

