langen^A large man in a tuxedo was waiting there for us with a warm smile.^@


br

langjp　……面識はないが、服装から右代宮本家の使用人だろうと察する。\

langen^......I didn't recognize his face, but judging by his clothes, I guessed he was a servant of the Ushiromiya Head Household.^\


