langen^It was probably returning to its home port on Niijima.^@

br

langjp　船長がお別れの手を振ってくれる。@

langjp　真里亞も律儀に手を振り返していた。\

langen^The captain waved his hand in farewell.^@
langen^Maria conscientiously waved her hand back. ^\


