langjp　傾斜を少しでも感じさせないために道を捻ってあるんだろうが、@俺的には潔く直線の階段か何かにしてもらった方が嬉しい。@

langen^I'd guess the path was made all twisty so the slope wouldn't seem too steep,^@^ but personally, I'd have been happier if they'd had the guts to make some stairs in a straight line.^@
br

langjp　……絶対これ、勿体ぶって距離感を出すためにわざと道を捻ってあるぞ…。\

langen^......No doubt they made the path twist on purpose, to put on airs of distance and importance...^\

