br

langjp　…お互い様か。@受験を控えた高校生なら、誰だって将来への不安は隠せねぇさ。\

langen^...Maybe we were in the same boat.^@^  Any high-schooler with exams approaching would have trouble hiding their anxiety for the future.^\

