;＜夏妃

langen^"How nice to see you, Battler-kun.^@^  You've grown quite tall, haven't you?"^@

ld l,$BUT_waraiA1,23



langjp「え、ぁ、はい！@　食ったり食べたり食事したりしてたらいつの間にかこんな身長に。」\

langen^"Oh, uh, yep!^@^  Six long years of eating well, sampling various cuisines, and deriving sustenance from Mother Earth's bountiful gifts.^@^  Hard work, but I pulled through."^\

ld r,$NAT_WaraiA1,80



langjp「さすが男の子ね。@身長はいくつくらいあるの？」@
langen^"Growing just like a boy, I see.^@^  How tall are you now?"^@

ld l,$BUT_aseruA1,80



langjp「１８０かな？@　つーか伯母さん、そこは、食べてばっかりじゃねぇかーって突っ込んでくださいよ〜ん！」\
langen^"I guess about 180 cm?^@^  But Aunt Natsuhi, that's where you're supposed to say `Heck, sounds like all you did was eat'!"^\

ld r,$NAT_defA1,80



langjp「え？@/

langen^"Huh?^@/

ld r,$NAT_tukareA2,80



langjp　……あぁ、くす、ごめんなさいね。」@
langen^  ...Oh, *giggle*, I'm sorry."^@

br

langjp　伯母さんは遅れて笑いに付き合ってくれたが、どこが笑うべきツボか理解できてないようだった。\
langen^After a short pause, she did laugh with me, but it seemed she couldn't quite figure out what she was supposed to be laughing at.^\

