langen^"Well, that might've been true six years ago,^@^ ...but it hasn't been that way lately.^@^  In fact, he's off in his own little world so often that he doesn't even show up at family meals.^@^  ...Still, I figured he'd at least come down today.^@/

ld l,$JES_AkuwaraiA1,80



