langen^In this sealed room, a dense dust danced through the air, which was thick with the stench of chemicals that exuded a mix of suspicious odors.^@

br

langjp　しかもそれはどことなく甘く、重く。@
langen^...Those odors were somehow sweet...and heavy.^@

br

langjp　まともな鼻を持つ人間なら、入って最初にやることは間違いなく窓を開けて換気することだろう。\
