langen^"Why is the Ushiromiya blood so incompetent?!?!^@^  Is there no one worthy to inherit the glory I built?!^@^  Aah, of course, I know, this is part of Beatrice's curse, I know it!!^@^  ...Hah, you Golden Witch, are you trying to take revenge against me in this way?"^\

