langen^"They aren't absurd, they're right on the mark.^@^  I'm sure he'd like to somehow make his business succeed and recover his losses, but his debt keeps getting bigger!^@^  He's just trying to cover up the failure of one gamble by making an even bigger one.^@^  It's only natural that he'd try to grab any source of funding close at hand!^@^  Let me be frank.  Nii-san, what you're doing is embezzlement.^@^  You're betraying Father.^@^  You know that we'll have the courts settle this after it's all over, right?^@^  Do you think that kind of person has any right to call themselves the Successor to the Ushiromiya Head Family?"^\
