;＜譲治
langen^"Ahahahaha.^@^  In addition to the patron theory, there's also a theory that she was Grandfather's first love.^@^  ...Either way, although it's been several decades since he met her, even now she holds a special place in his heart.^@^  ...Which must mean that he's still captivated by her."^\
