langen^...At that point, even Hideyoshi noticed and started to buy back the stock, but the stockholders realized that the company was undergoing an acquisition maneuver...^@^and each demanded a ridiculous price for the shares that Hideyoshi was trying to buy back.^@
br
langjp　金額交渉の余地のない秀吉を苛み続けていた。\
