langjp……実は以前、この碑文を手帳に記しましてな。@夜な夜な、寝る前に挑んでみたのですが、@……はっはっは、実に難しい。@お迎えが来るまでの間、ゆっくり楽しむことができそうです。@源次さんこそ、いかがですかな？」\
langen^  ......Actually, I once wrote this epitaph down on my notebook.^@^  Night after night, I would try to solve it before going to sleep, ^@^......but, hahaha, it really is hard.^@^  It looks like we might have some free time to relax and consider it before someone comes to get us.^@^  What do you say, Genji-san?"^\
ld r,$GEN_MajimeA2,80

