langen^"Uu-!^@^  Wear it on your arm when you want your heart to be at peace.^@^  Put it in your wallet and your money won't decrease!^@^  If you hang it from a doorknob, bad things can't get in!^@^  It's a really convenient charm!"^@
cl r,23
