langjp「そうだな。@薔薇たちもラッキーだったと思うぜ？@　台風の前に戦人たちを歓迎できたんだからよ。」\
;＜朱志香
langen^"You're right.^@^  Still, I think the roses were pretty lucky.^@^  After all, they got to welcome all of you before the typhoon."^\
