langen^  ...So, I ended up sticking close to home even for high school.^@^  Man, I hate this island.^@^  I just wanna go live in a city.^@^  I don't care if rain or even spears fall from the sky, as long as I can move to a city where I can wear casual clothes and sandals...^@^and can get to a convenience store in less than five minutes..."^\
