langjp「………なるほどな。@祖父さまがメシの席にも顔を出したくない理由が、よーくわかったよ。@/
langen^".........I get it.^@^  Now I totally see why Grandfather hates coming down for meals.^@/
ld r,$JES_OdorokiA1,80

langjpうちの親たちにはすっかり幻滅だぜ！@　カネだの遺産だの！@　よくもまぁ、あそこまで大っぴらに！」\
;＜朱志香
langen^  I'm so disillusioned with our parents right now!^@^  All that about money and the inheritance!^@^  How can they act like that right out in the open?!"^\
ld l,$BUT_aseruA1,23

langjp「俺の場合は、クソ親父に幻滅しきってるからよ。@これ以上、評価の下がりようがないぜ。@いっひっひ！」@
;＜戦人
langen^"Well, I'm already completely disillusioned with my old bastard.^@^  There's no way I could think any worse of him.^@^  Ihihi!"^@
ld r,$JES_KomaruA1,80

langjp「そ、そんなの私だって同じだぜ！@　しかし……、今夜のには呆れたぜ。@心底呆れたぜ…。」\
;＜朱志香
langen^"Th-That's exactly the same for me!^@^  Still, ...that freakin' shocked me.^@^  Shocked me to the core..."^\
langjp　朱志香はイラつきながら俯く。@
langen^Jessica looked down at the floor, irritated.^@
br
langjp　…普段は親のことを悪ぶって言っているが、実際は心の底からそうというわけでもないのかもしれない。@
langen^...She was always talking about how bad her parents were, but maybe she hadn't really felt that way deep inside.^@
langjp　朱志香のショックの深さからそれがうかがえた。\
langen^The depths of Jessica's shock made that clear.^\
bg M1F_S1aN,0
ld l,$GEO_majimeA1,23
langjp「……未成年の君たちはご両親に養育してもらってるからわからないだろうけど。@……お金を得るというのは、単純な綺麗事じゃないよ。@未成年である今にそれを理解しろとは言わない。@……でも、ご両親なりに何かの努力をしていることだけは認めてあげてほしいな。」@
;＜譲治
langen^"...You're all minors being supported by your parents, so you might not understand,^@^ ......but getting money is neither a simple nor a pretty thing.^@^  I won't try to force you to understand right now, since you're still kids.^@^  ......But even so, I want you to realize that your parents are just doing their best in their own way."^@
ld r,$BUT_KomaruA1,24

langjp「………やれやれ。@譲治の兄貴は人間ができてるぜ。」\
;＜戦人
langen^"......Oh great,^@^ George-aniki's gotten all mature."^\
ld c,$JES_nayamuA1,24

langjp「譲治兄さんは、社会人になってバリバリ働いてるけどよ。@……カネとか財産とか、そういう話になったら、ウチの親父たちみたいに強欲むき出しのハゲタカになれるってのかよ…？」\
;＜朱志香
langen^"George nii-san, I know you're working hard as a full-fledged member of society,^@^ ......but does that mean you turn into a shameless, greedy vulture like our parents whenever you start talking about money and assets...?"^\
ld l,$GEO_KomaruA1,80

langjp「…………………自分だけの話だったら、そんなことはしたくないよ。@/
langen^".........If it were only for my own benefit, then no, I wouldn't want to do that.^@/
ld l,$GEO_majimeA1k,80

langjpでも、家族や社員、部下やその家族の生活を背負ったら、…戦わなければならない時もあるかもしれない。」@
;＜譲治
langen^  However, when your family and your employees, your subordinates and their families are all counting on you, ...there are some times when you must fight."^@
ld c,$JES_KomaruA1,80

langjp「………私はそんな戦い、嫌だぜ。@祖父さまの遺産がどうのこうのなんて話、ヘドが出るぜ。」@
;＜朱志香
langen^".........I hate that kind of fight.^@^  That back and forth about Grandfather's inheritance just makes me wanna puke."^@
br
langjp　朱志香は唾を吐き捨てるような乱暴な仕草をする。@
langjp　…そのトゲトゲした様子から最大限の傷心が感じられた。\
langen^Jessica pretended to spit violently.^@
