langen^"...More or less.^@^  Those four siblings are always piling up secret agreements when they come together to discuss the division of Grandfather's inheritance.^@^  ...They're saying that some unknown fifth person has appeared and is trying to make things even more complicated, and there's no way that'll make for a peaceful conversation.^@^  Just when you think they're snarling at each other, they'll set up a common front.^@^  ......Natsuhi nee-san's not the only one getting headaches."^\

