langen^"......Yes.^@^  Battler-kun, your way of reasoning isn't bad.^@^  In our current situation, there isn't enough information to either accept or deny that a 19th person exists.^@^  ......But if you spin the chessboard around and think that way, we can deny the existence of a 19th person with near certainty."^\

