langen^"In order to unite his troops, Shingen showed his excellent leadership in many ways.^@^  For example, when a soldier succeeded well in battle, he would immediately honor them with a medal.^@^  Normally, that kind of thing was put off until after the war, and they were all awarded at once."^\
