langjp「だから、…それが命令。@………今夜よく考えて、明日その返事を見せて欲しい。」@
langen^"So, ...that's my order.^@^  .........I want you to think about it well tonight and show me your answer tomorrow."^@
ld r,$SHA_HajiraiA1,80

langjp「…………………。」@
langjp　紗音は頷き返す。\
langen^"..............."^@
langen^Shannon nodded back.^\
langjp　……これまでの交際の日々の積み重ねがあり、今日がある。@
langjp　…紗音にとって今日のこの瞬間は、決して不意打ちなものではない…。\
langen^...Today was the culmination of their many days spent together.^@
langen^...This moment certainly hadn't come as a surprise to Shannon...^\
ld l,$GEO_defA1k,80

langjp「………そろそろゲストハウスに戻ろうか。@これ以上遅いと、みんなを心配させちゃうよ。」@
langen^".........We should be getting back to the guesthouse soon.^@^  If we take any longer, we'll make everyone worry about us."^@
ld r,$SHA_HajiraiA2,80

langjp^^!s0「……あ、/
