langen^A mixture of exaltation and uncertainty gave her a feeling that she couldn't easily describe.  It swelled up in her chest until it felt like she was about to burst.^@
br
langjp　使用人室の前で一度だけ深呼吸をし、心を落ち着かせてから扉を開いた。\
langen^After stopping for a second in front of the servant room to take a deep breath and calm her heart, she opened the door.^\
;se1 16
