langen^^!d400^ ...Genji-sama told me to come and help you."^\
ld l,$GOH_hohoemiA1,23

langjp「あぁ、そうですか…。それは助かります。@そろそろ戸締りの見回りに行きたかったのですが、ここを空けてもいいものか困っていたのです。@何しろ、旦那様方の会合はまだだいぶ続きそうですからね。@いつ何時、お茶のご用命があるかもわかりませんし。」\
langen^"Ah, is that so...?^@^  That's a relief.^@^  I was just about to go check that the mansion was fully locked up, but I felt uneasy about leaving this room unmanned.^@^  After all, Krauss-sama and the others' meeting looks as though it will continue for quite some time.^@^  They might request some tea at any moment."^\
ld r,$SHA_majimeA2,80

langjp「そうですよね…。@では、どうしましょうか…、私が留守番を、」@
