langen^It was still cold, without any trace of a fire being lit, so of course there were no signs of breakfast being made either.^\
langjp　…あってはならないことだが、郷田が寝坊しているのかもしれない。\
langen^...Though it would have been inexcusable, perhaps Gohda had overslept.^\
langjp　使用人も人間だ。@
