langjp「………源次。@…すぐに警察に連絡しなさい。@台風が通り過ぎるまでは来られないでしょうが、どうすればいいか指示を与えてくれるはずです。」@
langen^".........Genji,^@^ ...contact the police immediately.^@^  They probably won't be able to come until the typhoon passes, but they should be able to tell us what to do next."^@
ld r,$GEN_defA1,24

