;＜絵羽
langen^"......I'm sure it'll be worth submitting it to the police as evidence,^@^ but Kanon-kun usually has it, and he used it to unlock the shed just now.^@^  It'll probably have Kanon's fingerprints on it.^@^  Also, that key was handed to Genji-san just now, and he took it with his bare hands.^@^  ...It doesn't look like it'll be very useful as evidence."^\
