langen^Only Kanon had returned to his usual calm expression.^@
langen^...However, that probably didn't mean he'd been able to wipe out the shock.^@
br
langjp　…何もない虚空を睨み続けている彼の目には、今は何も映っていなかった…。\
langen^...Nothing was reflected in his eyes as he stared into empty space...^\
