langen^"It's reasonable to think that the culprit...no, culprits...are multiple in number and fairly well armed.^@^  They'd have to be, wouldn't they?^@^  They had to assault the four in the dining hall and kill them, drag a total of six bodies all the way to the storehouse beyond the rose garden, and arrange for that disgusting makeup and the graffiti on the shutter.^@^  ......There's no way that a single culprit could carry out all of that on their own, right?"^\
