;＜絵羽
langen^"It's simple.^@^  ......Father's study is a closed room, with no way in or out except for that key, right?^@^  I want to verify whether that's true.^@^  There is one entrance to Father's study.^@^  What about the window?^@^  Any other entrances or exits?"^@
