ld c,$HID_majimeA1,24

langjp「……落ち着いてぇな、夏妃姉さん。@確かにお父さんは部屋にいたと誓ってくれればいいんやで？@　それだけなのに、何でそんなに取り乱しとるんや…？」@
;＜秀吉
langen^"...Calm down, Natsuhi-san.^@^  All you've gotta do is swear that Father definitely was in that room.^@^  Why are you gettin' so worked up...?"^@
ld l,$NAN_KomaruA4,23

langjp「…そ、…それもそうです。@夏妃さんは嘘をついていない。@それだけのことじゃありませんか…。」\
;＜南條
langen^"...Th-That is correct.^@^  Natsuhi-san isn't lying.^@^  Shouldn't that be the end of it...?"^\
ld r,$EVA_WaraiA1,24

langjp「だから説明してほしいのよ。@お父様がどうやって部屋からいなくなったのか。@…窓は内側からしっかり閉じられていた。@扉も同じよぅ？@/
langen^"Then I want you to explain.^@^  How did Father manage to disappear from the room?^@^  ...The window was closed tight from the inside.^@^  The same was true for the door, right?^@/
ld r,$EVA_AkireA1,80
langjp　……今朝、夏妃姉さんが間違いなくお父様に会ったというなら、@…夏妃姉さんには、“開かぬ扉”の密室から如何にしてお父様が部屋からいなくなったかを説明してもらわなくちゃ。@じゃないと、姉さんが嘘つきってことに、やっぱりなっちゃうものねぇ？」\
langen^  ...This morning, if you really met with Father,^@^ ...then you must explain how Father disappeared from this `unopenable door' closed room scenario.^@^  If you don't, that'd mean you're lying after all, right?"^\
bg M1F_S1aR,23
ld l,$NAT_IkariB1G,64

langjp「貴方という人はどこまで私を愚弄すればッ……！！！」\
langen^"How far do you plan to mock me...?!!!"^\
ld r,$EVA_ikariA2,63

langjp「反論したいなら、ぜひしなさいな？！@　そうね、今すぐこの場で釈明をしてみなさい？@　そうしたら、貴方を疑ったことを謝ってあげてもいいわ。@あの書斎の密室から、お父様は如何にして抜け出したのか！！」\
langen^"If you want to argue back, go ahead!!^@^  That's right, try explaining it right here, right now.^@^  If you do, I'll apologize for suspecting you.^@^  How did Father manage to get out from that closed room?!!"^\
ld l,$NAT_odorokiB1G,80

langjp「そんなこと、説明もできませんし、不要です！！」\
;＜夏妃
langen^"I cannot explain, and there's no need for me to do so!!"^\
ld r,$EVA_futekiA1,80

langjp「そう？@　なら私が説明してあげるわよぅ？@　私の立場も姉さんの立場もいいとこどりの、とても仲良しな説明なんだから！@　……姉さんの言う、今朝の時点でお父様が在室していたことを信じてあげるわよ。@でも、次に扉が開かれた時にお父様はいなかった。@ここまでは異存ないわよねぇ？」\
langen^"Really?^@^  Then let me explain it.^@^  Let's take the best parts from my perspective and yours and come up with a more friendly explanation!^@^  ...I'll believe what you said about Father still being in his room this morning.^@^  However, the next time the door was opened, Father wasn't there.^@^  You don't have any objections so far, right?"^\
ld l,$NAT_ikariB1G,80

langjp「貴方の言うことにこれ以上、耳を傾ける気はありませんッ！！@　その軽薄な口を噤みなさい！！」\
langen^"I have no desire to hear anything more you have to say!!^@^  Shut your frivolous mouth!!"^\
;bg M1F_S1bR,0
;ld c,$EVA_MajimeA1,24

bg black,22
bg map02,22

langjp「私の推理はこうよ？@　扉から姉さんしか出入りしていないことは、私が２回確認している。@そしてレシートもそれを立証している！@　にも関わらずお父様を部屋から出すパズルの答えは？@/
langen^"My reasoning goes like this, okay?^@^  I can confirm that on both occasions, you were the only one to go through that door.^@^  And the receipt proves it!^@^  So, what's the answer to the puzzle of how Father left the room?^@/
;ld c,$EVA_futekiA1,80

langjp　窓よ！@　窓から出したのよ。@……夏妃姉さんはお父様を、３階の書斎の窓から中庭に突き落としたのよッ！！！」\
langen^  The window!^@^  He was sent out the window.^@^  ...Natsuhi nee-san, you threw Father out of the third story window of the study into the courtyard!!!"^\
bg M1F_S1cR,0
ld l,$NAT_IkariB1G,24
;se1 30

langjp「おおっぉおぉお、おのれぇええええぇえぇッ！！！」@
;＜夏妃
langen^"Y----YOUUUUUUUUUUUUU!!!"^@
ld c,$KAN_KomaruA1,24

langjp「奥様、堪えてください…！！」@
;＜嘉音
langen^"Madam, please, endure it...!!"^@
ld r,$KUM_OdorokiA1,24

langjp「絵羽さま…、どうかお止め下さいませ……！！」\
;＜熊沢
langen^"Eva-sama, ...please stop this...!!"^\
bg M1F_S1aR,23
ld r,$EVA_IkariA2,24

langjp「その後、中庭に転落して死んだお父様の遺体は、@夏妃姉さんが屋敷内の戸締りを確認すると言って出て行った時にどこかへ隠したのよぅ！@/
langen^"After that, when you left and said you were going to check the doors and windows,^@^ you took Father's corpse, which had fallen in the courtyard, and hid it!^@/
ld r,$EVA_futekiA1,80

langjp　多分、その時に、死亡時刻を偽る工作もしたんでしょうねぇ？！」\
langen^  That was probably when you took some measures to fake the time of death, right?!"^\
ld l,$HID_MajimeA2,23

langjp「……蔵臼兄さんたちの事件も、さらに昨夜のベアトリーチェの事件もひっくるめて！@　夏妃さんが怪しい可能性が非常に高いっちゅうことだ…。@本当ならこんなこと言いたくはない。@/
langen^"...This ties in with the case regardin' Krauss nii-san and the rest, and also the case regardin' Beatrice last night!^@^  There's a really good chance we've got reason to suspect Natsuhi-san in all those cases...^@^  Normally, I wouldn't want to say this.^@/
ld l,$HID_KomaruA2,80

langjp…だが、もうぶちまけてしまったからには仕方がない…！@　頼むわ、夏妃姉さん！@　どうか自分の無実を説明してくれんか！！@　さもないとわしは、あんたを疑わなきゃならんのや…！！」\
langen^  ...But now that it's out in the open, there's nothin' else I can do...!^@^  Please, Natsuhi nee-san!^@^  Please explain how you can be innocent!!^@^  Otherwise, I can't help but suspect you...!!"^\
ld c,$NAT_IkariA1G,64

langjp「なぜこの私がッ！！@　この私が、右代宮夏妃がこのような辱めをぉおおおぉ！！！」\
langen^"Why me?!!^@^  Why must I, Ushiromiya Natsuhi, be insulted like thiiiiiiiiiiis?!!!"^\
bg black,1
E_A
langjp　……………ふむ。@…言い分は出揃ったようだな。\
langen^......Hmmmm.^@^  ...Looks like we've got everyone's views on record now.^\
