langjp　…駄目だな、^~ib~^全然駄目だぜ？^~ib~^@　絵羽伯母さん。」\
langen^  ...It's useless.  ~ib~It's all useless,~ib~^@^ Aunt Eva."^\
ld r,$JES_OdorokiA1,24

langjp「…だ、…駄目って何がだよ、戦人…。」@
;＜朱志香
langen^"...Wh-What do you mean, `useless'...?"^@
