langjpらどこで待ったって同じだろ？！@　逃げも隠れもしない。@客間でテレビでも見ながら、のんびり現れるのをまとうじゃねぇかよ、ベアトリーチェさまをよぉ！」\
;＜朱志香
langen^en it doesn't matter where we wait, does it?!^@^  I'm not gonna run away or hide.^@^  Why don't we just take it easy in the parlor, watching TV or something while we wait for this Beatrice-sama to appear?!"^\
