langjp^^!d700…いや、頭を抉られてた。」@
;＜戦人
langen^"...That's Grandfather...^@^  He was burned in the incinerator, and our eyes were so drawn to that part that we didn't notice,^@^ ...but his forehead...^/
langen^^!d700^no, his head had been gouged."^@
