langjp「祖父さまが、……第四の晩の犠牲者？@　じゃ、…じゃあ嘉音くんは…！」\
;＜朱志香
langen^"Grandfather was...the victim of the fourth twilight?^@^  Th-Then, Kanon-kun was...!"^\
