langjp「……………誰も生き残れなくていいんだよ。@……第十の晩には、黄金郷にたどり着く。」\
;＜真里亞
langen^"......It's okay if no one's left alive.^@^  ...On the tenth twilight, we finally arrive at the Golden Land."^\
langjp“第十の晩に、旅は終わり、黄金の郷に至るだろう”@
langjp“魔女は賢者を讃え、四つの宝を与えるだろう”\
langen^`On the tenth twilight, at journey's end, you shall attain to the power of the Golden Land's treasures, once and for the last time.'^@
langen^`The witch shall praise the wise and bestow four treasures.'^\
ld c,$MAR_AkuwaraiA2,80

langjp「……お祖父さまは死を恐れてなんかいなかったんだよ。@………ほら、四つの宝の２番と３番を見てごらんよ。」\
;＜真里亞
langen^"...Grandfather wasn't afraid of dying.^@^  ......Look at the second and third of the four treasures."^\
bg Mlib_1a,0
ld r,$GEO_MajimeA2k,23

langjp「…………“一つは、全ての死者の魂を蘇らせ。@一つは、失った愛すらも蘇らせる”。@……つまりお祖父さまは、自分がこの儀式の途中で死んでしまっても、やがては復活できると信じてた…？」\
;＜譲治
langen^"......`One shall be the resurrection of all the dead souls. ^@^  One shall be the resurrection of the love that was lost'.^@^  ...So Grandfather believed he would eventually be revived, even if he died partway through this ceremony...?"^\
ld l,$JES_IkariA1,23

langjp「馬鹿馬鹿しいぜ、妄言だぜ！！@　死んだらそれまでだろ？！@　死者は生き返らない。@人類が何千年もかけて追い求め、結局は未だに成し遂げられない奇跡だぜ？！@　つまり、こういうことだろ？@　死後の世界で再会できて蘇ることができるとか、そういう類だろ？！」\
;＜朱志香
langen^"Ridiculous!^@^  That's insane!!^@^  When you die, it's over, right?!^@^  The dead don't come back to life.^@^  Isn't that a miracle humanity's been chasing after for thousands of years and still hasn't accomplished?!^@^  So is this what it means?^@^  Something like, you'll be able to meet them in the afterlife, where they'll be restored?!"^\
ld c,$BUT_NayamuA2,24

langjp「……朱志香の言い分通りだとするなら、……こいつはつまり、@老い先短い祖父さまが恋に狂っての自殺紛い、@いや、…壮大な無理心中ってことなのか…？！」\
;＜戦人
langen^"...If what you're saying now is right, ...would that mean that...^@^Grandfather, whose remaining life is slim and who's been driven mad by love, is committing suicide...^@^no, ...a massive forced group suicide...?!"^\
