langjp　中身を検める前から、これは未開封の、未知の封筒であることがわかる！@
langen^I picked it up.^@^  ...It was still sealed with wax.^@
langen^Even without disturbing its contents, I realized that this was an as-yet unopened envelope, an unknown envelope!^@
br
langjp　俺はペーパーナイフになど頼らず、乱暴に千切り開け、中の手紙を引きずり出した。\
langen^Without relying on a paper knife, I tore it open and pulled out the letter inside.^\

