;＜譲治
langen^"But Aunt Natsuhi, please, calm down...!^@^  There's no reason to shoot Maria!^@^  Please remain composed...!^@^  The letter was meant to provoke us, but it's nothing to be afraid of!^@^  Even the culprit is scared of what will happen tomorrow.^@^  They're scared of the police!^@^  Right now, this island is free from the reach of the law, but that's only because it's isolated by this typhoon!^@^  Once the typhoon passes, the law will return!^@^  So you mustn't shoot...!!"^\
