br
langjp　譲治との縁は、本来なら絶対にありえなかった運命。@
langjp　……そして、それを捻じ曲げるほどに、魔女の力が強大であると。\
langen^First, that Shannon's relationship with George was a fate that'd be absolutely impossible under normal circumstances.^@
langen^...Second, that the power of the witch was great enough to overturn that fact.^\
