langen^"Indeed.^@^  ...Well, I only answered the summons on a whim.^@^  After all, in this period where magic has long been denied, here was a man who was without a scrap of talent, yet so desperate to succeed.^@^  I thought I'd drop by and poke some fun at him, and that's when my luck ran out.^@^  *cackle*cackle*cackle*."^\

