langen^"...And thanks to that, I'm in this state.^@^  I've been sewn in place on this island for several decades now, without even a friend to drink tea with.^@^  ...No matter whom I try to talk to, my voice doesn't reach them, and no matter where I go, I cannot do anything.^@^  Such boring decades."^@
