langen^"So, you destroyed that Japanese-style guest seating and returned the area to a blank slate for a time.^@^  Thanks to that, the meal I had ordered was finally delivered, and my power came back, you could say.^@^  However, so far, only the aperitif has arrived.^@^  It will still be quite some time before the main dish.^@^  As I am now, I'm even more fragile than a shoe store fairy."^\

