langen^"...I hear Battler-sama will be coming for the first time in six years.^@^  Presumably, Milady wants to stay up late into the night with her three cousins.^@^  ...Make the preparations.^@^  You do not need to tell Madam."^@

ld r,$SHA_WaraiA3,24

