langen^"...Assuming the typhoon doesn't stray too far from its course, it may affect the boat ride back for the family members.^@^  The family conference's schedule might be extended until Monday or Tuesday.^@^  ...Our task may be a long and tiring one, but I earnestly ask that you take care not to make any blunders."^\

ld c,$GEN_MajimeA2,80

