langen^"Kumasawa-san, you really like those stories.^@^  Okay, sure, it'd be pretty creepy if a thunderbolt took out a shrine.^@^  But, well, it was all worn out from the start.^@^  Maybe it just got washed away by some big wave.^@^  Hahahahaha."^\

