;＜留弗夫
langjp「３年凌げれば資金的危機は脱出できる計算でした。@…まさか、ここで刺されるなんて…、本当についてない…！」\
langen^"If we'd known this would happen, we never would've started diversifying..."^@
langen^"The calculations were that we could escape a capital crisis if we managed to endure for three years.^@^  ...To think we'd be stabbed at a time like this...^@^  How bad can our luck get...?!"^\
ld r,$RUD_akuwaraiA1,80

langjp「ホップステップジャンプの、ステップでコケちまったんだもんなぁ。@泣けるぜ。」@
