langjp「……社長。@簿外に資金はありますか。@我々の把握していない資金です。」\
langen^"Banks are no good.^@^  They only bet their money on winners.^@^  ...The economy's improving, but we can't show weakness to the banks."^@
langen^"...President,^@^ do we have access to any funds that are unaccounted for?^@^  Funds we are unaware of?"^\

