langjp「…………お前がどんな手で来ようが、俺はお前を信じない！@　…その一点を俺が貫き通す限り、俺に負けはない。@ってことはだ。@このゲームはお前に勝てないように出来てるぜ…？」\
langen^"......No matter what moves you come at me with, I won't believe in you!^@^  ...As long as I stand my ground on that point, I won't lose.^@^  And that means...^@^this game's built in a way that makes it impossible for you to win..."^\

bg G1F_S1aP,0
ld c,$BEA_WaraiA1,23

langjp「そうかも知れぬ。@しかしな？@　ゲームを何度繰り返すかは妾が決めるぞ。@そして妾が勝ち、そなたが負けを認めるまで何度でも繰り返されるぞ…？」\
langen^"Perhaps you're right.^@^  However,^@^ I'm the one who decides how many times we'll hold this game.^@^  We'll repeat it over and over again, until I win and you acknowledge your defeat, see...?"^\

ld c,$BEA_futekiA1,80

langjp「つまりこれは拷問よ。@そなたが妾に屈服するまで続く永遠の拷問…！@　そなたが妾を、魔女の存在を認めるまで永遠に続く！」\
langen^"In other words, this is torture.^@^  An eternal torture that shall continue until you surrender to me...!^@^  It shall go on endlessly, until you acknowledge me and the existence of witches!"^\

bg G1F_S1cP,0
ld l,$BUT_niramuA2,24
me2v 5,20

langjp「……なら、俺もお前が根負けするまで、何度でも無限に付き合ってやるぜ。@意地の張り合いってヤツでは負けた例がねぇんだ。」\
langen^"...Then I'll play your game endlessly, as many times as it takes, until you run out of patience.^@^  I've never lost in a test of stubbornness."^\

ld r,$BEA_AkuwaraiA1,24

langjp「どこぞの魔女にでも入れ知恵されたか…？@　くっくっくっく、まぁ良い…！」@
