ld r,$BEA_futekiA1,80

langjp「さぁ、始めようではないか！@　そなたの指し手はすでに知り尽くしておる。@手の内を知られた守りなどタカが知れておる！@　同じ手で凌ぎきれると思うでないぞ！！」\
langen^"Then let us begin!^@^  I already know all of your moves.^@^  A defense doesn't amount to much if the plan behind it is known!^@^  Don't think you'll be able to defy me with the same moves!!"^\

