langen^"...Hoh.^@^  So, even though you've quit being furniture, you have no fear of death.^@^  ...It seems you believe this will bore me, but you couldn't be more wrong.^@^  ...The thought of seeing whether you can hold onto that view until the last moment...merely serves to intrigue me more and more.^@^  *cackle*cackle*cackle*cackle*cackle*cackle*...!"^\
