langen^"The sauce here is Bordelaise.^@^  Of course, the red wine base I used was excellent even among those made in Bordeaux, but in addition, I prepared an original blend of this house, ^@^a blend of choice alcohol from around the world to further deepen the taste.^@^  This sauce is limited to this year.^@^  I sincerely hope you all enjoy your meal."^\

