langen^"Krauss-sama,^@^ today is the annual family conference.^@^  As a dinner for those who normally live far away and who have traveled far from across the world to gather together,^@^ I realized it would be most fitting to have a sauce made from a blend of fine alcohols from all over the planet that have never met each other before,^@^ so I had it specially prepared."^\

