langjp「………朝を迎えた、ということは…。@……………ふむ。@……どうやら、最初の生贄は逃れたということらしい。@……ルーレットの目が幸運だったのか、…我が努力の賜物なのか、@区別の付かぬところが何とももどかしいが、それは言うまい。」\
langen^"......Morning has come, which means...^@^......hmmm.^@^  ...It would appear I've avoided becoming one of the first sacrifices.^@^  ...Was I merely lucky when the roulette was spun, ...or is this the fruit of my efforts?^@^  How irritating that I cannot tell the difference, but I mustn't be bothered by such trivialities."^\

bg Mlib_1a,23

