langen^They were all facing urgent situations and needed a lot of money fast.^@
br
langjp　そしてそのアテは、書斎に閉じ篭った金蔵に代わって、右代宮家の当主を代行する蔵臼しかない。\
langen^And the only one they could turn to was Krauss, who spoke for the Ushiromiya Head now that Kinzo spent his time shut up in his study.^\
