langjp　蔵臼が、金蔵が財産に関心を失ったのをいい事に、@それを私物化し摘み食いをしていることは、ずいぶん前から薄々と感付いていた。\
langen^For a long time now, they'd vaguely sensed that Krauss was taking advantage of the fact that Kinzo had lost interest in his own wealth,^@^ and they suspected that he'd started embezzling that wealth to suit his own purposes.^\
langjp　自分たちが軌道に乗っている時は、憎々しく思いながらも、見て見ぬふりをしていたが、@…自分たちにもカネがいる今の状況では、それはとても黙認できるものではない。@
langen^Despite being disgusted by this, they'd turned a blind eye to it while everything was still going smoothly for them,^@^ ...but now that they needed money, they really couldn't afford to let it slide.^@
br
langjp　絵羽は、留弗夫と楼座に連帯を呼び掛け、それを突く事で蔵臼からカネを引き出そうと企んでいる…。\
langen^Eva had asked Rudolf and Rosa to form an alliance, and they were now scheming to take that money away from Krauss.^\
bg Ship_S2b,26
ld r,$HID_MajimeA1,24

langjp「………わしも、そして留弗夫くんも社長や。@社員の生活を背負っとる身や。」@
langen^"......Rudolf-kun, both you and I are company presidents.^@^  We're responsible for the livelihood of our employees."^@
ld l,$RUD_NayamuA1,23

langjp「楼座も社長ですよ。@まぁ、道楽ですが。」\
langen^"Rosa's a president too.^@^  Well, as a hobby."^\
ld r,$HID_KomaruA1,80

langjp「そうやな、失礼。@/
langen^"That's right, sorry.^@/
ld r,$HID_MajimeA1,80

langjp……つまり、わしらは誰もが、背負うモノを持っとるっちゅうことや。」@
langen^  ...Basically, we've all got responsibilities."^@
ld l,$RUD_MajimeA2,80

langjp「…俺も、幹部連中の前で啖呵を切った以上、土下座しても、泥を啜ってでもカネを引っ張ってこなきゃならない。」\
langen^"...Now that I've thrown down the gauntlet in front of the executive board, I've gotta bring in the money, even if it means getting down on my knees or drinking mud."^\

ld r,$HID_majimeA2,80

langjp「お互い様や。@…わしも、わしを信じて付いて来てくれた社員たちを裏切れん。@……それこそ、蔵臼兄さんの首根っこを引っ掴んででも、カネを引っ張り出さんといかんのや。」\
langen^"Same here.^@^  ...I can't betray the employees who've trusted me and followed me for so long.^@^  ...That's why I need to get some money out of Krauss nii-san, even if I have to grab him by the neck."^\
bg ship_S2a,23
ld r,$RUD_DefA2,24

langjp「姉貴は、昔っから兄貴とは犬猿だ。@…その兄貴と全面対決しなくちゃならねぇんだから。@そりゃあカリカリもするだろうよ。」@
langen^"Aneki and Aniki have always been at each other's throats.^@^  ...And now she's gotta challenge Aniki head on.^@^  It's no wonder she's on edge."^@
ld l,$HID_fumuA1,23

langjp「やっぱり、絵羽は蔵臼兄さんとは昔っから仲が悪かったんか…？」\
langen^"So, Eva really has had a bad relationship with Krauss nii-san since long ago...?"^\
ld r,$RUD_majimeA1,80

langjp「本人、話しませんか？@　そりゃあもう、盛大に。」@
langen^"Hasn't she talked about it?^@^  They were always at each other's throats."^@
ld l,$HID_KomaruA1,80

langjp「昔の話は、聞いても話してくれんのや。@……思い出したい話がないんやろな。」\
langen^"She never talks about the past, even if I ask.^@^  ...She probably doesn't want to remember."^\
textoff
cross1 3000,70,0,0,0,0

bg white,25
bg Sea_1a,22

langjp「…姉貴は昔っから、要領も良くて頭が良かった。@成績も良かった。@それに比べ、兄貴は凡才だった。@…ただ、側にいるだけでも充分にプレッシャーだったろうに、姉貴はわざわざそれを誇示してして兄貴を追い詰めていた。」\
langen^"...She's always been brainy and shrewd.^@^  Her grades were good too.^@^  Compared to that, Aniki was just average.^@^  ...The simple fact she existed would've been pressure enough, but she kept boasting about it and driving him into a corner."^\
langjp「……あほやなぁ…。@何でそない敵愾心剥き出しで追い詰めるんや。@そういうのは要領がいいとは言わん。」\
langen^"...That fool...^@^  Why drive him into a corner so openly?^@^  I'd hardly call that shrewd."^\
bg Ship_S2a,26
ld c,$RUD_AkuwaraiA1,23

langjp「ははは、確かに。@/
langen^"Hahaha, no kidding.^@/
ld c,$RUD_DefA2,80

langjp………姉貴は、女に生まれたことを悔やんでた。@…だから、男というだけの理由で、当主を継ぐことが決まっている兄貴が、多分、許せなかったんだ。@…だからことあるごとに自分の方が優秀であると親父に誇示していたっけ。」\
langen^  ......Aneki...regretted being born a woman.^@^  ...So, she probably couldn't forgive Aniki, since he was chosen to succeed the Head just because he was a man.^@^  ...She'd always boast to Dad, letting him see that she was better at every little thing."^\
bg Ship_S2c,0
ld r,$HID_fumuA1,24

langjp「お父さんは古いタイプのお人や。@男女には差別的な価値観を持っとった。@/
langen^"Father really is an old-fashioned person.^@^  Gender discrimination was part of his system of values.^@/
ld r,$HID_KomaruA1,80

langjp…自己顕示の強い絵羽は、少々嫌われてたんとちゃうか…。」@
langen^  ...I'll bet Eva's eagerness to prove herself made him dislike her a bit..."^@
ld l,$RUD_NayamuA1,23

langjp「………………………。」\
langen^"............"^\


