langen^"......Human feelings can change far more often than the number of sand grains on a beach.^@^  Krauss is such a stupid man that Father's eventually gonna realize it, even if we don't prove it for him.^@^  ...When that happens, the wall that separates man from woman will be demolished by Father himself, who set it up in the first place.^@^  That day will surely come."^\
