langen^"G-George is a son I'm proud of, one who won't embarrass himself no matter where he goes...!^@^  The dream I wasn't granted might come true for George...!^@^  Jessica's a delinquent in both her grades and her behavior.^@^  And she's a woman!^@^  If only Jessica would step down, George would become the heir...!"^\
