quakey 4,600

langjp@　山羊頭が盆踊りを始めるのかとぼやいたら、山羊頭がうようよ現れて、@太もも姉ちゃんたちが７人も出てきてその上、今度は執事まで出てきやがった！！@　わけわかんねぇよ、もういい加減にしやがれよッ！！」\
langen@^  First I grumble about goat-headed people doing the Bon dance, and then goat-heads start showing up in swarms,^@^ and since then, not only have those seven ass nee-sans appeared, but now there's even a butler!!^@^  It doesn't make sense, cut it out!!"^\

mld r,$BEA_AkuwaraiA5,80

langjp「ところで戦人。@気付いていたか？@　こやつとそなたの対面だが、…これが本当の“悪魔の証明”であることを気付いたかな？」@
langen^"By the way, Battler,^@^ did you notice?^@^  Did you realize that meeting him is a true `Devil's Proof'?"^\

mld l,$BUT_odorokiA2,80

langjp「あ、悪魔の証明だとぉ…？！@　どういう意味だよ…。」\
langen^"A-A Devil's Proof...?!^@^  What do you mean...?"^\

mld r,$BEA_futekiA1,80

langjp「こやつは、こう見えても７２柱に名を連ねる、生粋の悪魔でな。@つまり、妾は悪魔を直接連れて来て、まさにその存在を証明して見せたわけだ。@/
langen^"He may not look like it, but this guy's one of the 72, a genuine demon.^@^  In other words, I've brought a demon right in front of you, which truly proves that they exist.^@/

mld r,$BEA_AkuwaraiA2,80

langjpくっくくくくくくく！！@　ロノウェは地獄に爵位を持つ、序列２７位の大悪魔よ。@なかなかに使える男でな。@高給で召し上げて、妾の世話をさせておるのだ。」\
langen^  *cackle*cackle*cackle*cackle*!!^@^  Ronove holds a noble rank in hell, the 27th highest-ranked Great Demon.^@^  He's a pretty useful man.^@^  I summoned him at high cost and made him serve me."^\

mcl a,24
mld c,$RON_DefA1,24

langjp「ご紹介いただけまして光栄です。@/
langen^"It is an honor to meet you.^@/

mld c,$RON_WaraiA2,80

langjp地獄の貴族に名を連ねど、@今は卑しいニンゲンの分際で、悪魔も裸足で逃げ出すような大魔女であられるベアトリーチェさまの家具頭として仕える身ですよ。」\
langen^  While my name is amongst those of the nobles of hell,^@^ I now serve as the head furniture of Beatrice-sama, who despite being a vulgar human, is a Great Witch of such caliber that demons flee before her."^\
mcl c,0
mld r,$RON_WaraiA2,0
mld l,$BEA_WaraiA2,23

langjp「くっくくくくくく。実に使える男なのだが、何しろ口の減らぬヤツでな。@時に主への敬いを忘れるのが玉に瑕よ。」\
langen^"*cackle*cackle*cackle*cackle*  He's a very useful man, but he's impudent with his words.^@^  Frustratingly enough, he sometimes forgets to respect his Master."^\

mld r,$RON_akuwaraiA1,80

langjp「言葉遣いに関しましては、契約書から漏れておりましたもので。@そのように契約を変更いたしますか？」@
langen^"Nothing in my contract specifies the manner in which I am to speak.^@^  Would you like to change that contract?"^@

mld l,$BEA_futekiA2,80
langjp「妾も退屈せぬからそれでいい。@くっくっくっく！」\
langen^"It keeps me entertained, so it's fine.^@^  *cackle*cackle*!"^\

mcl l,24

langjp　ベアトリーチェはけらけらと笑うと背を向ける。@
langen^Beatrice turned her back to him, cackling.^@

mld r,$RON_defA1,80

br
langjp　その背中に一礼した後、ロノウェは戦人に向きかえり、無邪気な笑顔を見せながら右腕を突き出した。@普通に解釈するならば、それは握手を求めるものだったからだ。\
langen^After bowing once to her back, Ronove turned back to Battler and stuck out his right hand, showing off an innocent smile.^@^  Normally, this would mean that he was asking for a handshake.^\

mld l,$BUT_niramuA3,23

langjp「……な、…何の真似だよ。」\
langen^"...Wh-What is this supposed to be?"^\

mld r,$RON_waraiA2,80

langjp「私もお嬢様のわがままに振り回されている身です。@その意味では、私たちは良き友人になれるかと思いますよ。@これは友情の握手です。@/
langen^"I am another who has been subjected to Milady's whims.^@^  In that sense, I am sure we could become good friends.^@^  This is a handshake of friendship.^@/

mld r,$RON_WaraiA1,80

langjp……もちろん、悪魔の契約の締結を意味するものではありませんのでご安心を。」\
langen^  ...Of course, this in no way implies your entry into a contract with a demon, so fear not."^\

