langjp　存在しないことは証明不能だからだ。\
langen^However, if we follow the rules of the `Devil's Proof', you can't deny that she exists, even if there's no proof that she does.^@
langen^Because it's impossible to prove that something doesn't exist.^\

langjp　……そう、これまでに、さんざん苛まれてきた“悪魔の証明”を逆手に取ったことになる。@
