langen^Therefore, it's impossible to deny the 19th person's existence.^@
langen^Beato used the `Devil's Proof' to make denying her own existence impossible,^@^ but this time it's become my weapon.^\

bg black,22

langjp　この論法が罷り通るなら、１９人目どころか、@島には俺らの与り知れない人間が、@それこそ１０人、１００人隠れていたとしても、その存在を否定することはできない。\
langen^If we can get away with this argument, then forget just a 19th person,^@^ this island could be full of people we don't know about,^@^ and even if there were 10 or 100 of them, she still couldn't deny that they existed.^\

langjp　前回、前々回のゲームで登場した殺害現場の中には、非常に手の掛かる凝った現場がいくつか登場する。@
langen^In the last game and the one before that, among the murder scenes that showed up, ^@^there were several that were extremely intricate and must've taken a lot of effort to set up.^@
br
langjp　それらは単独の犯人が構築したと考えようとすると、非常に困難になってしまう。\
