langen^"Very well.^@^  I will teach you about my move.^@^  First of all, you are stating that `the culprit is not among the 18 = the culprit is a 19th person'.^@^  *cackle*cackle*!^@^  ...So if you use the contrapositive, it ends up like this.^@/

