langen^Now, if the contents of the 19th person box are empty, ^@^that'll automatically mean that the bomb's in one of the other 18 boxes.^\

langjp　俺は１８人の箱の中身全てを調べ、@どの箱にも爆弾が入っていなかったことを証明すれば、@無事に１８人の無実を証明できるだろう。@
langen^If I could examine what's inside all 18 of those boxes,^@^ then as long as I can show that the bomb isn't in any of them,^@^ I'll be able to safely show that the 18 are innocent.^@
