langen^"......*cackle*cackle*^@^  Regardless of whether I responded to his courting or not, ^@^having a man so desperate for me was...well, as a woman, it wasn't so unpleasant."^\

mld l,$BEA_futekiA2,80

langjp　……しかし妾は決して首を縦には振らなかった。@何とかその戒めから逃れようとしたが、@あれの結界は強固で破れなかった。」@
langen^"...However, I never accepted his proposal.^@^  I tried to find some way to break through his guard, ^@^but that barrier was firm, and I couldn't crack it."^@

