langen^"...And then?"^\

mld l,$BEA_NayamuA1,80

langjp「様々な抵抗を試みた結果、@金蔵の結界から逃れるには、肉の体を捨てるほかないという結論に至った。@……肉体というものは、魔法を語る上でとても制約の多い器なのだ。」\
langen^"After trying to resist in various ways,^@^ I eventually reached the conclusion that, to escape from Kinzo's barrier, I would have to throw away this body of flesh.^@^  ...The physical body is a vessel with many restrictions for a magic user."^\

mld r,$BUT_oyaA1,80

langjp「肉の体を捨てる……？@　何だよそれ。@幽体離脱みたいなものか？」\
langen^"Throw away your body of flesh...?^@^  What does that mean?^@^  Something like an out-of-body experience?"^\

mld l,$BEA_DefA2,80

langjp「まぁ、そんなものと考えれば良い。@しかし、妾は精霊ではない。@魔女ではあっても、元々は肉の体で生れ落ちた人間だ。@その妾にとって肉体を捨てるということは、@死を意味するほどではないにしても、それに準ずる覚悟が必要だった。」\
langen^"Well, if you want to think of it that way.^@^  However, I am no spirit.^@^  Even though I am a witch, in the beginning, I was born with a human's body of flesh.^@^  So for me, throwing away that physical body,^@^ while it didn't mean the same thing as death, it did require a similar level of resolve."^\

