langen^"...Oh, he was a fearsome person.^@^  Normally, when the object of one's unrequited love shows that she is willing to die, it should be enough to bring that person to their senses, even if their love has lasted a hundred years.^@^  ...Perhaps that's why even he managed to become a sorceror of sorts.^@^  ...*cackle*."^\

