langen^"Heh, ^@^in the beginning, I showed a little interest, thinking that there might be some huge hint hidden here,^@^ but the more I ask, the weirder this story starts to get.^@^  I get the feeling that even though this is supposed to be a game about denying witches,^@^ I'm suddenly being forced to just swallow this story about witches."^\

