langen^"If I said `a witch exists' in red, you would have no room for argument.^@^  However, since the reason would never have been made clear to you, Battler-sama, you probably wouldn't accept it.^@^  However, after being told that in red, you would have no room for argument and would not have been shown any proof."^\

