langen^"Since you would not be able to play your next hand, it would never become Milady's turn, ^@^and the game would stop there for all eternity.^@^  As a result, Milady would be unable to force you to submit.^@^  ...That would be a deadlock situation.^@^  In order to avoid that, ^@^I am unable to answer questions of this nature in red."^\

