langen^However, when that created a little too much of a disturbance and reached Natsuhi's ears, ^@^she made a fuss, thinking that some suspicious person might have been entering and leaving.^@
br
langjp　何でも、使用人全員を叩き起こして、屋敷中を確認させるという大騒ぎもあったという。\
langen^Apparently, she had roused all the servants and had them check throughout the mansion.^\

bg Mhal_2cN,4

