langjp　ベアトリーチェはその巨大な双頭の塔の狭間に優雅に浮かびながら、師匠を見下ろし、絶対の優位に嘲笑う。@
langen^As Beatrice elegantly floated in the gap between the massive two-headed towers, she looked down on her teacher, sneering with a sense of absolute superiority.^@
br
langjp　巨大なる塔を双肩に並べる魔女はあまりに小さく見え、@まるで大樹の間を舞う蝶のように見えた。\
langen^With the two massive towers lined up behind her shoulders, the witch looked very small,^@^ like a butterfly dancing between huge trees.^\


