langen^"Yes.^@^  In a losing battle, it is essential to withdraw your troops as soon as possible to try and minimize your losses.^@^  ...The difficult part is gauging whether it's a losing battle or not.^@^  ...Your opponent's butler seems to have calmly made that decision."^\

