;＜留弗夫
langen^"Well, yeah.^@^  After all, they're sweetfish, right?^@^  People say they live in rivers with clean water, so there are countless rivers that might work.^@^  Any stream Dad innocently went sweetfish-fishing in was probably buried by the development later.^@^  It'd be different if we had a map from before the war or a person who knew a lot about how the area was before the war, but..."^\

