langjp「………鮎はシャケみたいなモンや。@淡水魚だが、生まれてすぐは海に出るんや。@そして大きくなると川に戻ってきて生活し、@そこに産卵して生涯を終えるんや。@/
langen^"......Sweetfish are like salmon.^@^  They're freshwater fish, but they go out into the ocean right after they're born.^@^  When they get big, they go back to the river to live there, ^@^and then they spawn there and end their lives there.^@/

ld c,$HID_WaraiA2,80

langjpま、一度は家を出るが、大きくなって戻ってきて卵を産むってな辺りは、@一族繁栄的なイメージがあるかもしれんな。」\
;＜秀吉
langen^  Well, they leave their home at one point, but when they get big, they come back and lay eggs.^@^  Might be able to link that to the idea of clan prosperity."^\

