langjp「……これは私の妄想なんだけど。@…実は私、鮎の川のイメージから、家系図を疑ったことがあるの。@鮎は一度海へ出るけど、また生まれた川に帰ってきて産卵するんでしょう？@　………まるで私のことみたいだなって思って。」\
;＜楼座
langen^"...This is just my wild idea, ^@^...but the impression I get from a sweetfish river makes me suspect a family tree.^@^  The sweetfish go out into the ocean for a time, but they return to the river where they were born to spawn, right?^@^  ......It reminds me of myself."^\

ld r,$EVA_akireA2,24

