langen^"You're joking.^@^  Actually, I understand it easily.^@^  ...In other words, you're saying that the more people there are who don't believe in magic,^@^ and the stronger their will is, the more the effects of our magic are divided.^@^  ...Yeah, if it's so formulaic, I'll have to rethink my method of attack."^\

