mendef 28

ld r,$BEA_fukigenA3,80

langjp「絵羽は秀吉にずっと看病されて部屋で寝ていたであろうが。」@
langen^"Wasn't Eva sleeping in her room the whole time as Hideyoshi cared for her?"^@

ld l,$RON_defA1,80

langjp「…秀吉も共犯で、両名でアリバイを作った可能性を提示されました。」\
langen^"...He put forth the possibility that Hideyoshi was an accomplice, and that the two worked together to create an alibi."^\

ld r,$BEA_fukigenA2,80

langjp「秀吉まで疑うか…！@　殺害時には客室にいたと赤にて叩き斬ってやれば良いではないか。」\
langen^"He even suspects Hideyoshi...?!^@^  Couldn't you have struck back by saying in red that he was in the guest room at the time of the murder?"^\

;bg black,22
ld l,$RON_akuwaraiA1,80

langjp「……それも考えましたが、何れにせよ、数手先でいくつかの大駒を奪われてしまうかもしれません。@…それに、この手が新しきベアトリーチェさまが打たれた布石の可能性もありますので、@それを尊重することと致しました。@…申し訳ありません。」\
langen^"...I also thought of that, but multiple important pieces might have been taken several moves later.^@^  ...And, because this move might be connected to the new Beatrice-sama's strategy,^@^ I acted out of respect to her.^@^  ...My apologies."^\

ld r,$BEA_fukigenA3,80

langjp「布石か。@………あやつ、頭が切れるようだからのぅ。@/
langen^"Strategy, you say?^@^  ......Her mind does seem to be sharp.^@/

ld r,$BEA_fukigenA2,80

langjp…ふん、好きにさせておくが良い。@どこまでやれるか見物だ。」\
langen^  ...Hmph, we can let her do as she pleases.^@^  It will be quite a show to see how far she can go."^\

ld l,$RON_WaraiA1,80

langjp「ぷっくくくく。@そう仰ると思いました。@……弟子が可愛くないので、ご機嫌斜めとお見受けしますよ。」\
langen^"Pukukukuku.^@^  I thought you would say that.^@^  ...I see that the un-cuteness of your disciple has left you in a bad mood."^\

ld r,$BEA_KomaruA1,80

langjp「余計なお世話だ。@あやつめ、ここからの篭城をどう崩していくつもりなのか。@妾もじっくり拝見させてもらうとするぞ。@/
langen^"That's none of your business.^@^  I wonder how that one plans to destroy this barricade going forward.^@^  I shall keep a close eye on her.^@/

ld r,$BEA_OdorokiA2,80

langjp……………あー、それで…。@…ば、…戦人の機嫌の方はどうなのか。」\
langen^  ......Oh, and...^@^...h-how was Battler's mood?"^\

ld l,$RON_waraiA2,80

langjp「落ち着いておられるように見えました。@やはりお嬢様が相手でないと盛り上がらないと仰っておいででしたよ。」@
langen^"It appeared as though he had calmed himself down.^@^  He did say that he couldn't get fired up after all, without you as his opponent."^@

ld r,$BEA_WaraiA2,80

langjp「そ、そうか、そうであろうそうであろう！@　第四の晩以降は、やはり妾が復帰しないと戦人も寂しかろうな…！」\
langen^"R-Really, well that's no surprise, no surprise at all!^@^  If I don't return for the fourth twilight and after, Battler will probably be lonely himself...!"^\

ld l,$RON_defA1,80

langjp「ぷっくっくっく…。@それでは私はこれで失礼させていただきます。@…美味しいクッキーを焼かねばなりません。@せめてお嬢様と戦人さまのお話が弾みますように。」@
langen^"Pu ku ku ku...^@^  And with that, if you would excuse me.^@^  ...I need to go bake some delicious cookies.^@^  I must at least enliven the discussion between you and Battler-sama, Milady."^@

ld r,$BEA_WaraiA3,80

langjp「うむ！@　あいつ、お前のクッキー、ぼりぼり食ってたなぁ。@やはり男の子だからお腹が空くのであろう。@多めに焼いてやれ…！」\
langen^"Indeed!^@^  That guy really was munching your cookies, wasn't he?^@^  It's no surprise that a boy can eat so much.^@^  Make a lot of them...!"^\

ld l,$RON_waraiA2,80

langjp「畏まりました。@クッキーでテーブルを埋めてご覧に入れましょう。」@
langen^"Certainly.^@^  I shall make enough cookies to bury the table."^@

ld r,$BEA_WaraiA2,80

langjp「それが良いぞ…！」\
langen^"That sounds great...!"^\

