;＜蔵臼
langen^"...Don't worry about us,^@^ but it would pain my heart to keep the children hungry...^@^  I must be responsible as a parent."^\

ld r,$NAT_OdorokiA2,80

langjp「あ、あなた…！@　お父様が亡くなられた今、右代宮家の当主はあなたです。@そのような危険を冒すことは許されません…！」\
;＜夏妃
langen^"D-Dear...!^@^  Now that Father is dead, you are the Ushiromiya Family Head.^@^  It is not permissible for you to take on such a danger...!"^\

