langjp「………留弗夫さんと、最初から付き合っていたのは私だったのよ。@……明日夢さんが、白々しく間に入り込んできて、@…ちゃっかりと懐妊したのよ。\
langen^"......I was the one who went out with Rudolf-san first.^@^  ...Asumu-san blatantly cut in between us...^@^and shrewdly got pregnant."^\

ld c,$KIR_MajimeA1,80

langjp　……留弗夫さんは悪くないわ。@あの女が、体を武器にして誑し込んで、さらに嫌らしく立ち回って、@留弗夫さんに婚約せざるを得ないよう追い詰めたのよ。」\
langen^"...I don't blame Rudolf-san.^@^  That woman used her body as a weapon to seduce him, and then acted even more repulsively,^@^ cornering Rudolf-san and forcing him to get engaged to her."^\

bg black,22

langjp　明日夢さんは戦人くんを身篭ってたわ。@
langen^Asumu-san had been carrying Battler-kun.^@
br
langjp　そして同じ頃、私もまた男の子を身篭ってた。@
langen^And at the same time, I was also carrying a boy.^@
br
langjp　…運命的なことに、私たちの出産日は共に同じ日だったわ。\
langen^...As fate would have it, our delivery dates were on the same day.^\

me2v 16,80
bg Different_spiral_1a,22

langjp「そして明日夢さんは戦人くんを出産したわ。@…だけれど私は流産したの。@………思ったことがあるわ。@もし流産したのが明日夢さんで、出産したのが私だったなら。@……留弗夫さんは婚約を解消して、私と結婚してくれたかしら？@　……でも私は子どもを産めなかった。@だから明日夢さんが死ぬまで。@そして縁寿を懐妊するまで、私は明日夢さんを呪ったわ、嫉妬したわ。」\
langen^"Then, Asumu-san gave birth to Battler-kun.^@^  ...But I had a miscarriage.^@^  ......I think about it, sometimes.^@^  What if Asumu-san had had the miscarriage...and I had been the one to give birth?^@^  ...Would Rudolf-san have broken off his engagement and married me?^@^  ...But I couldn't give birth to my child.^@^  So until Asumu-san died, ^@^and until I got pregnant with Ange, I cursed Asumu-san and was jealous."^\

se1v 21,70
bg black,22

langjp　明日夢さんなんか死んでしまえ。@
langen^Let Asumu-san die.^@
br
langjp　そして私と再婚してほしいって、ずっとずっと嫉妬して呪って、そしてやっと明日夢さんが死んだ。\
langen^Then, I want him to marry me.^@^  In my envy, I kept cursing like that, over and over, until Asumu-san finally died.^\

langjp　私は確信したわ。@
langen^I was certain.^@
br
langjp　私には魔法の力があって、それが呪いとなって明日夢さんを殺したんだって確信したわ。\
langen^I was certain that I'd used the power of magic to curse and kill Asumu-san.^\

langjp　でも、私の嫉妬の炎は治まらない。@
langen^But that didn't quell the flames of my envy.^@
br
