langen^"Aniki, you were engaged to Shannon-chan, right?^@^  You promised that you'd build a life and a home together in the future, right?!^@^  ......Compared to how huge that future was, ...compared to how huge that happiness was,^@^ ...stuff like my pain doesn't even come close...!!"^\

