langen^...And she reflected upon how difficult it was to revive a single life, something she'd been able to play around with however she wanted to in the past.^\

langjp　二人はいつまでも、力強く抱擁を交し合う。@
langjp　…百億の言葉でも伝えられない気持ちを、そうして伝え合っていた…。\
langen^The couple kept on embracing each other tightly.^@
langen^...By doing that, those feelings that couldn't be communicated with a billion words...were shared...^\

