langen^"Didn't you take Battler-sama's innocent heart,^@^ and quite thrillingly, splendidly, atrociously, mercilessly, and unculturedly go just a little too far...?^@^  And you insulted him to the highest degree, enough to make one uneasy.^@^  Most people would be crushed after something like that.^@^  Pukukukuku, so much so that they wouldn't want to see your face ever again."^\

