langen^"Just now, he described fighting with you as closing the distance.^@^  But you can't measure distance with a single eye.^@^  Only with two eyes are things visible in three dimensions, and only then can distance be judged.^@^  ...And even when you have two fields of vision, it's pointless if they're in the same place.^@^  You can pin down witches more accurately when they're far apart."^\

