langen^"*cackle*cackle*cackle*!!^@^  What confidence, Ushiromiya Battleer!^@^  After you've said so much, ^@^it makes me want to trick you all over again, you see......?^@^  I can't wait to see what kind of face you'll make when you realize you've been duped once more!^@^  How pleasant, kuhhahahahahahahaha!!"^\

