ld r,$BEA_WaraiA4,24

langjp「マフラーがチャームポイントだと思ってな。@あとは耳だ！@/
langen^"I figured the muffler was his charm point.^@^  And the ears!^@/

ld r,$BEA_waraiA2,80

langjp　獣耳はいいぞォ、実に可愛い！@　あとで妾にもかじらせよ。@くっくっく！」\
langen^  Animal ears sure are nice, truly cute!^@^  Let me nibble 'em later.^@^  *cackle*!"^\

bg garden_Se1c,24
