langjp「ありがとう、ベアトリーチェー！！@　素敵なプレゼントを本当にありがとう！！」\
langen^"Thank you, Beatrice!!^@^  Thank you very much for the wonderful present!!"^\

ld r,$BEA_DefA2,24

langjp「礼には及ばぬ。@そなたの素晴らしき魔法と友人に敬意を表したまでよ。@/
langen^"There is no need for thanks.^@^  This is out of respect for your wonderful magic and your friend.^@/

ld r,$BEA_FutekiA2,80

langjp………そして、この域にまで達したそなたは、もはや見習いをいつ卒業してもおかしくない。@今日より、さらに新しく楽しい魔法を伝授してやろう。@/
langen^  ......And, now that you have reached this level, it would not be odd for you to graduate from being an apprentice at any time.^@^  From now on, I shall instruct you on even more new and fun magic.^@/

ld r,$BEA_FutekiA1,80

langjp……これより、原初の魔女見習いのマリアと名乗るが良い。」\
langen^  ...From this point forward, you may call yourself MARIA, an Apprentice Witch of Origins."^\

ld l,$MAR_OdorokiA1,80

langjp「原初の魔女って…？」@
langen^"A Witch of Origins...?"^@

ld r,$BEA_MajimeA2,80

langjp「うむ。@造物主の道を求める魔女の称号よ。@今は身の回りの小物に魔力を吹き込む力しか持たぬ、エンチャンター（付与魔術師）でしかない。@/
langen^"Indeed.^@^  It is the title of a witch who seeks to become a Creator.^@^  Right now, you are just an Enchanter (a magician specializing in forms of magical enhancement) who has only enough strength to breathe magical power into the small objects around her.^@/

ld r,$BEA_MajimeA1,80

langjp……しかし千年の修行を経たならば、その胸の内より魔法大系はおろか、銀河を生み出すことも夢ではあるまい。」\
langen^  ...But after one thousand years of training, you could conceivably use the magical compendium that resides inside your heart to create a galaxy."^\

ld c,$WAL_DefA2,24

langjp「……原初の魔女の才能はとても稀少。@幼き日には誰もが持つのに、誰も持ち続けることが出来ない。@/
langen^"...The talent of a Witch of Origins is very rare.^@^  Even though everyone has it when they are young, no one can continue to hold onto it.^@/

;ld c,$WAL_WaraiA2,80

langjp……この称号は、あなたが穢れなき心を失わなかったことの証でもありますね。」\
;＜ワルギリ
langen^  ...This title is also proof that you have not lost your untainted heart."^\

ld l,$MAR_WaraiA2,80

langjp「うー！！@　原初の魔女、すごい！@　なる！@　真里亞、原初の魔女見習いー！」@
langen^"Uu-!!^@^  A Witch of Origins, awesome!^@^  I'll become one!^@^  I'm Maria, an Apprentice Witch of Origins!"^@

cl r,23
ld r,$SAK_WaraiA1,24

langjp「真里亞、すごいねすごいね…！@　原初の魔女、すごいすごい、うりゅー！」\
langen^"Maria, that's so incredible...!^@^  A Witch of Origins, incredible, amazing, uryu-!"^\

bg garden_Se1a,23
ld c,$BEA_DefA1,24

langjp「やがては一人前の原初の魔女、マリア卿を名乗ることになろう。@……さくたろうだけでなく、そろそろそなたも、その格に相応しい身なりをしても良い頃であろうな。@/
langen^"Eventually, you will be able to call yourself a full witch: Lady MARIA, Witch of Origins.^@^  ...It may be a good time now to give not only Sakutarou, but you as well, an appearance fitting for your rank.^@/

ld c,$BEA_WaraiA1,80

langjp………それ。@見習いとはいえ、魔女の名を語るに相応しき服装を与えよう。」\
langen^  ...Here.^@^  I shall give a proper outfit for one who, while still an apprentice, is worthy of using the title of a witch."^\

