langen^It seems that you need to imagine a vast space to gain the mental concentration for using magic.^@
br
langjp　なので私は、幼い頃に家族で出掛けた小旅行で、@峠のドライブインの展望台から麓を見下ろした時のことを思い出し、その光景で心象世界を描いてみたのだ。\
langen^So I remembered the time from my younger days when my family had gone on a small vacation, ^@^when I had looked down towards the base from a viewing platform at a rest stop on a peak,^@^ and I tried painting this scene in my mental world.^\

