langjp「…………自己満足か。@聞こえは悪いですが、そいつが実は、人生ってヤツではないかと思ってます。」@
;＜天草
langen^"......Self-satisfaction, huh?^@^  It sounds bad when you say it, but I think that's actually what life is all about."^@

ld l,$ENJ_FumanA2,23

langjp「……へぇ。@傭兵稼業で死線を潜った末に至った答えだったなら、なかなか味わい深いじゃない。」\
langen^"...Oh?^@^  If that's the answer you've reached after hovering over the line between life and death in the mercenary business, that's probably pretty deep."^\


ld r,$AMA_majimeA1,80

