;＜南條


ld l,$SHA_odorokiA1,80

langjp「郷田さんはいざという時、頼りになるし、熊沢さんは経験豊富で落ち着いてるし…。@きっと力になってくれると思います…。」\
langen^"When the going gets tough, Gohda-san is reliable, and Kumasawa-san is knowledgeable and calm...^@^  I'm sure they'll be able to help the children..."^\
;＜紗音


ld c,$KLA_AkuwaraiA2,24

langjp「……はははは。@そうだと良いがな。」@
langen^"...Hahahaha.^@^  Yes, that certainly would be comforting."^@
