langen^"...It's not a place with a tangible image like that.^@^  It's really like the inside of a dream.^@^  When you're there, it's very gentle, very peaceful, ^@^...and you're allowed to sleep as long as you want, like when you wake up early on a day off, lying on a futon."^\

