;＜ガァプ
langen^"...I-I admit it.^@^  ...I made light of your...Human power..."^\


ld l,$GEO_akuwaraiA1k,80

langjp「違うね。@これが、愛を覚えた男の強さなのさ。」\
;＜譲治
langen^"That's wrong.^@^  This is the strength of a man who's experienced love."^\

