;ld c,$JES_AkuwaraiA1,80
langjp　恋する乙女ってのはな、無駄だから諦めるって考えがねぇんだぜッ！！」\
;＜朱志香
langen^  A girl in love doesn't even think about giving up just because it's useless!!"^\

langjp　その時、ロノウェは確かに見る。@
langjp　朱志香の両拳が赤く熱のような光を帯びるのを。\
langen^At that time, Ronove certainly saw.^@
langen^He saw the reddish glow of light that encircled Jessica's fists.^\

