langen^^!d800^...and I am the Ushiromiya Ange who has been left all alone.^\

langjp　初めは死ぬための旅だった。@
langjp　でも、今は違う。@
langen^At first, this was a journey to die.^@
langen^But not anymore.^@
br
langjp　何かを成し遂げる旅に変わっている……。\
langen^It's become a journey to accomplish something...^\

