langjp「うん。@……だからごめんね、二人とも。@あの日の私なら、何も躊躇わずにこの崖を降りるだろうけれど。」@
;＜縁寿
langen^"Yeah.^@^  ...So, I'm sorry, you two.^@^  Although, as I was back then on that day, I would've gone down that cliff without any hesitation."^@


