langen^...All of them stared blankly, wondering what in the world Battler was talking about.^\
langjp　愚かで身の程知らずの戦人も、さすがに自分が失言したことに気付きました。\
langen^Even the foolish, arrogant Battler realized that he hadn't chosen his words well.^\

