;＜朱志香
langen^"Th-That's right, that's right.^@^  ...None of the cases would've been possible for a human."^@
ld c,$SHA_OdorokiA2,24

langjp「そうですよね…。@だって、人間じゃ、説明がつかないことばかりじゃないですか…。」@
;＜紗音
langen^"That's true...^@^  After all, wasn't it full of things that humans couldn't explain...?"^@
