langjp「説明できなきゃ全て魔女なんて、俺はそんな論法は認めねぇ。@どうして電球が明るくなるのか、仕掛けを知らなきゃ全て魔法ってことになるのか？@/
langen^"I don't accept the argument that the witch must've been behind everything just because I can't explain it.^@^  Does this mean that if you don't know how a light bulb shines, then magic is the cause?^@/
