langen^"I won't forgive you, I'll never forgive you!!^@^  A witch?!  Magic?!^@^  I'll risk my body and soul to deny you...!!^@^  No matter what happens, I can't accept you!!^@^  Now that you've gone so far to piss me off, I'll never forgive you!!"^\
