langen^  Come, explain.^@^  Try explaining it all with `human tricks'!^@^  And learn how lowly humans are!!^@^  Let's see if what humanity has built up in a hundred years can oppose my thousand years!!^@^  That's what will make forcing you to submit so pleasant...!!"^\
