langen^Rosa felt uncomfortable, but she couldn't look away.^\

ld c,$BEA_nayamuA1,80

langjp「…………そなたの痛みは、すでに生まれながらにして運命付けられたものか。@…これは何とも辛いものよ。@…言わずとも良い。@わかる。@……わかる……。」\
langen^"......So, your pain was already fated by the time of your birth.^@^  ...How heart-breaking.^@^  ...You don't have to say it.^@^  I understand.^@^  ...I understand..."^\

