langjp　貴方を閉じ込める岩牢を掘り抜き、魔女の目玉を抉る武器にもなる。@
langen^A spoon can be used for more than just drinking soup.^@
langen^You can use it to dig through the prison you're locked in, or as a weapon to gouge the witch's eyes out.^@
br
langjp　……もちろん、永遠の岩牢の中で、水のようなスープを延々と啜り続けるのにも使えるだろうけど。\
langen^...Of course, you can also use the spoon to continually sip the watery soup inside your eternal cell.^\
bg Different_spiral_1a,2
