langen^...Don't get the wrong idea.  I have no intention of becoming your ally.^\
langjp　貴方に感情移入はするけれど、貴方の手助けはしない。@
langjp　…貴方が、テレビの前でその向こうの人物にいくらエールを送っても届かないのに似てるわ。@
langen^I do feel empathy for you, but I won't help you.^@
langen^...It's like I'm sitting in front of the television yelling at you on the other side, even though my voice won't reach you.^@
br
langjp　ダカラ、私ガ魔女ダッテ判ルデショウ？\
langen^SO, YOU UNDERSTAND THAT I AM A WITCH, RIGHT?^\

