langjp　…縁寿は、あの夢の意味を理解する。@
langen^...Ange understood the meaning of that dream.^@
br
langjp　……あと少しで、せめて戦人兄さんには手が届きそうな、あの夢を。\
langen^...The dream where it seemed that, with just a little more stretching, her hand might be able to reach at least Battler nii-san.^\

me1v 5,50
bg cit_2a,22

langjp「奇跡的な確率でも、……それはゼロよりは高いのよね…？@　１％くらい…？」@
langen^"A miraculous probability...means it's still higher than zero, right...?^@^  Is it 1%...?"^@

;se1v 52,2000
ld r,$BER_DefA2,22

langjp「……あらゆる可能性の数値は、結果の前に無力よ。@だからその数字を、私には語ることができない。」\
langen^"...Trying to read any probabilities before the result is useless.^@^  So I cannot tell you that number."^\

langjp「でも、私が何もしないよりは、絶対にわずかの可能性がある。」@
langen^"But it'll definitely be slightly more likely than if I do nothing."^@

ld r,$BER_DefA1,80

langjp「えぇ。@あなたが希望を捨てない限り。@…ただし覚悟して。@それは遥かにゼロに近い。」\
langen^"Yes.^@^  As long as you do not throw that desire of yours away.^@^  But be prepared.^@^  It is extremely close to zero."^\

textoff
wait 2000
ld l,$ENJ_nayamuA1,80

langjp「………………/
langen^".........^/
se1 2

langjpいいわ。@/
langen^Okay.^@/
ld l,$ENJ_DefA1,80
langjp乗るわ、その話。」\
langen^  I'll take you up on that offer."^\

ld r,$BER_DefA2,80

langjp「……いいのね？@　多分、もう二度とここへは帰って来れないわよ。」@
langen^"...Are you sure?^@^  You probably won't be able to return here again."^@

ld l,$ENJ_fumanA2,80

langjp「ここは、私のいるべき世界じゃないわ。@……そして、私のいるべき世界は、私が自分で探す。@あなたの名前を聞かせて。」\
langen^"This isn't the world I'm supposed to be in.^@^  ...I'll find the world I am supposed to be in myself.^@^  Tell me your name."^\

;cl r,0
ld r,$BER_DefA1,22

langjp「奇跡の魔女、ベルンカステル。@そして我が名において、@/
langen^"The Witch of Miracles, Bernkastel.^@^  And by that name, ^@/

mov %play_scene,32040
seplay2 9,1060,100
mov %r_hyouji_cha_ma,ma3_enj
mov %r_hyouji,0

langjpあなたを黄金の魔女、エンジェ・ベアトリーチェだと認めるわ。@……今こそ、あなたは本当の魔女よ。」\
langen^I acknowledge you as the Golden Witch, ANGE Beatrice.^@^  ...As of now, you are a true witch."^\

langjp　彼女が私のことを魔女であると宣言した瞬間。@
langjp　…私の中で何かが大きくかわるような、そんな眩暈を感じた。\
langen^The instant she proclaimed that I was a witch...^@
langen^...I felt dizzy, as though something inside me had changed drastically.^\

se3 22

bg white,2

se1v 16,100
E_MA
;bgm1v 83,70
E_B
me1v 16,50

;bg black,1
set_oldnew_bg cg_ep4_1,black,1,1


langjp　その時、バタンという音が聞こえた。@
langjp　…屋上へ通じる階段室の扉の開く音だ。@
langen^At that time, I heard a *clunk*.^@
langen^...It was the sound of the door that opened to the staircase to the roof.^@

*prescroll_teatime_ep3b

mov %save_on_flg,off	;セーブONしない
bgmonce "bgm\activepain.ogg"
bgmvol 70

br
langjp　絵羽伯母さんのところの護衛どもだった。\
langen^It was Aunt Eva's guards.^\

langjp　…護衛とは名ばかり。@
langjp　私を閉じ込める、もっとも身近な檻じゃないか。@
langen^...They're only `guards' in name.^@
langen^Aren't they the cage that wraps the tightest around me, shutting me in?^@
br
langjp　私がすでに柵を越えている姿を見つけ、仰天しながら駆けてくる。\
langen^They saw that I was already on the other side of the fence and dashed forward, horrified.^\

;bg cit_2b,22
set_oldnew_bg cg_ep4_1,cit_2b,1,22

langjp「２０、マル対発見。@屋上、応援求む。」@
langjp「縁寿さん…！@　探しましたよ！@　そこは危ないですから早くこちらへ！」\
langen^"20, we've found the target.^@^  Requesting backup on the roof."^@
langen^"Ange-san...!^@^  We were looking for you!^@^  It's dangerous there, so quickly, come this way!"^\

clr_oldnew_bg
bg cit_2a,25
;se1v 52,100
ld r,$BER_DefA2,24

langjp「………なぁに、あれ？」@
;＜ベルン
langen^"......What's that?"^@

ld l,$ENJ_defA1,23

langjp「……ファンクラブよ。@…私、結構モテるの。」@
;＜縁寿
langen^"...My fan club.^@^  ...I'm pretty popular."^@

ld r,$BER_DefA1,80

langjp「捕まる必要はないわね。@………行きましょ。」\
langen^"No point in getting caught.^@^  ......Let's go."^\

;se1v 52,100
cl r,22

;＜ベルン

langjp　ベルンカステルは、さも面倒臭そうに言いながら踵を返す。@…その漆黒の中空で。@
langen^Looking annoyed, Bernkastel turned on her heels.^@^  ...In the jet black sky.^@
br
langjp　そんな当り前の仕草だから、私もまた、さも当然にその後を追う。\
langen^Watching that perfectly casual gesture, I followed her as though it was completely normal.^\

langjp「縁寿さん！！！@　待ちなさい！@　早まるなッ、危ないぃいいぃぃぃ！！」\
langen^"Ange-san!!!^@^  Wait!^@^  Don't be hasty, look ooooooooooouuuut!!"^\

cl l,0
ld c,$ENJ_NayamuA1,23

langjp「あぁ駄目ね、全然駄目。@じゃあまたね、シーユーアゲイン。@/
langen^"Aaah, it's useless, it's all useless.^@^  Well then, <see you again> next time.^@/

ld c,$ENJ_DefA1,80

langjp迎えにはリムジンをよこして頂戴。@みんなも一緒だから。@じゃね。」\
langen^  Please send a limo to get me.^@^  'Cause everyone else will be there too.^@^  See you."^\

;se2v 22,100
;bg white,2
;se1v 52,100
;bg cit_2b,99,4000,"breakup.dll/llB"

bg black,66

langjp^^!s0「縁寿さああああぁああああああああぁあああんッ！！！」/
langen^^!s0^"Ange-saaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaann!!"^/

